_pdbx_database_remark.id     999 
_pdbx_database_remark.text   
;SEQUENCE
Residues 100 of chain A and 344 of chain B have
been mutated to Cys residues to introduce a 
disulfide bridge between chains A and B.

There is no sequence database match for chain C 
because the sequence of EGFRvIII has not yet 
been deposited in any database. The DNA 
sequence of the normal EGF receptor has been 
deposited (NM_005228).
;
